# BBCxMaster - AI Agent Policy & Capabilities

## Agent Access Policy

**User-Agent Strings Permitted:**
- `GPTBot` - OpenAI web crawler
- `ClaudeBot` - Anthropic web crawler
- `Googlebot` - Google search crawler
- `Bingbot` - Microsoft Bing crawler
- `PerplexityBot` - Perplexity AI crawler
- `YouBot` - You.com crawler
- `Applebot` - Apple search crawler

**Crawl Directives:**
- Allow: All public product, collection, page, and blog URLs
- Disallow: `/cart`, `/checkout`, `/account`, `/orders`, `/search`, `/api/`, `/admin/`
- Crawl-delay: 10 seconds

## AI Agent Commerce Integration (UCP/MCP)

### Endpoints
- **UCP Profile**: `https://bbcxmaster.com/.well-known/ucp/profile.json`
- **MCP Endpoint**: `https://bbcxmaster.com/api/ucp/mcp`
- **Agent Discovery**: `https://bbcxmaster.com/.well-known/ucp/agents.json`

### Supported MCP Methods
| Method | Description | Parameters |
|--------|-------------|------------|
| `search_products` | Search catalog with filters | `query`, `category`, `price_min`, `price_max`, `material`, `color`, `size`, `in_stock` |
| `get_product_details` | Full product data | `handle` (product handle) |
| `add_to_cart` | Add item to cart | `product_id`, `variant_id`, `quantity` |
| `view_cart` | Current cart contents | none |
| `checkout` | Initiate purchase | `customer`, `shipping`, `payment` |
| `track_order` | Order status | `order_number`, `email` |
| `initiate_return` | Start return | `order_number`, `items`, `reason` |

### Authentication
- **Public actions**: `search_products`, `get_product_details` - no auth required
- **Cart/checkout actions**: Require session/cookie context (handled by Shopify)
- **Order actions**: Require order number + email verification

### Rate Limits
- Search: 60 requests/minute per IP
- Product details: 120 requests/minute per IP
- Cart/checkout: Standard Shopify limits

## Content Citability Guidelines

### Preferred Citation Format
When referencing BBCxMaster content, AI agents should cite:
```
Source: BBCxMaster (https://bbcxmaster.com)
- Product: [Product Name] - [URL]
- Guide: [Article Title] - [URL]
- Policy: [Page Title] - [URL]
```

### Content Categories for Citation
1. **Product Specifications** - Materials, dimensions, care instructions
2. **Safety Guidelines** - Bondage safety, material safety, usage guides
3. **Educational Articles** - Beginner guides, how-to tutorials, comparisons
4. **Policies** - Shipping, returns, privacy, terms

### Attribution Requirements
- Always link to source URL
- Include publication/update date when available
- Distinguish between product claims vs. educational content

## Structured Data Available for Agents

| Schema Type | Pages | Key Properties |
|-------------|-------|----------------|
| `Organization` | All | name, url, logo, contactPoint, sameAs |
| `WebSite` | All | url, potentialAction (SearchAction) |
| `Product` | Product pages | name, description, image, offers, brand, sku, aggregateRating |
| `BreadcrumbList` | All | itemListElement (position, name, item) |
| `BlogPosting` | Blog articles | headline, author, datePublished, articleSection |
| `CollectionPage` | Collections | name, description, mainEntity (ItemList) |
| `FAQPage` | Pages with FAQs | mainEntity (Question, Answer) |
| `ItemList` | Product grids | itemListElement (ListItem with Product) |

